add("Structure of Atom", "H", "Uncertainty in position of an electron moving with velocity 300 m/s accurate up to 0.001% is: (m = 9.1 x 10^-31 kg, h = 6.63 x 10^-34 J·s)", ["1.93 cm", "0.193 cm", "19.3 cm", "1.93 mm"], 0, "Δv = 300 * (0.001 / 100) = 0.003 m/s. Δx ≥ h / (4 π m Δv) = 6.63x10^-34 / (4 * 3.1416 * 9.1x10^-31 * 0.003) = 0.0193 m = 1.93 cm.")
add("Structure of Atom", "M", "The number of radial nodes in a 3p orbital is:", ["0", "1", "2", "3"], 1, "Number of radial nodes = n - l - 1. For 3p orbital (n=3, l=1): Radial nodes = 3 - 1 - 1 = 1.")
