add("Basic Principles & Techniques", "H", "Stability of free radicals follows the order:", ["Benzyl > Allyl > 3° > 2° > 1° > Methyl", "Methyl > 1° > 2° > 3° > Allyl", "3° > Benzyl > Allyl > 2° > 1°", "1° > 2° > 3° > Benzyl"], 0, "Resonance stabilization makes Benzyl and Allyl radicals exceptionally stable: Benzyl > Allyl > 3° > 2° > 1° > ·CH3.")
add("Basic Principles & Techniques", "H", "In Lassaigne's test for detection of Nitrogen, Prussian blue precipitate/coloration is due to formation of:", ["Fe4[Fe(CN)6]3 (Ferriferrocyanide)", "Fe(SCN)3", "Na4[Fe(CN)6]", "FeSO4"], 0, "Sodium fusion extract reacts with FeSO4 and FeCl3 to form Prussian blue Iron(III) hexacyanoferrate(II): Fe4[Fe(CN)6]3.")
