add("Aldehydes, Ketones, & Carboxylic Acids", "H", "Rosenmund reduction converts an Acyl chloride (RCOCl) into an Aldehyde (RCHO) using hydrogen over catalyst:", ["Pd / BaSO4 poisoned with Sulfur or Quinoline", "Ni at 200°C", "LiAlH4 in ether", "NaBH4 in ethanol"], 0, "RCOCl + H2 --Pd/BaSO4 (poisoned)--> RCHO + HCl. Poisoning prevents further reduction to alcohol.")
